  "content": "\n\n<h1>伐木附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftimber-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/timber-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📖 說明</h2>\n<p>為斧頭新增的附魔，可一鋤採收多根相連的同類原木！（僅限原版斧頭與原版原木）</p>\n<p>可與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmagnetic-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">磁力附魔</a> 搭配使用！</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 不相容項目</h2>\n<p>不支援以下項目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂消失計時器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot timber_enchantment:timber</code></pre>\n<p>賦予附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s timber_enchantment:timber</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題回報</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或建議。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器代管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需點擊幾下即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供 24/7 客服支援與快速回應，絕不會讓問題阻礙您！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器代管服務\"></p>",
